Package: SAStoCSV
Title: Convert Irregular SAS Text Exports to CSV in Parallel
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Caleb", "Vinson", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads whitespace-delimited SAS text exports (and .sas7bdat
    files) that do not have a fixed column count row to row, pads or
    truncates each row to a declared schema while reporting how many rows
    were touched, and writes the result to CSV, optionally using a parallel
    cluster.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    data.table,
    parallel
Suggests:
    haven,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
